<section class="ziyu-hero">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div class="ziyu-hero__copy">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Chapter 03 · Concept</span>

      <h1 class="ziyu-display">MyJourney</h1>

      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
        A personal archive for goals, habits, memories, reflection, learning, and long-term becoming.
      </p>

      <div class="ziyu-hero__actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="ziyu-button">Follow the Concept</a>
        <a href="/pages/journal" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--ghost">Read Field Notes</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-hero__visual">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;">
        <img class="ziyu-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?q=80&w=1400&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="MyJourney">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--soft">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div style="grid-column: span 5;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Origin Story</span>
      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">Life is too meaningful to be scattered across disconnected apps.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-text-stack" style="grid-column: span 7;">
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">MyJourney is imagined as a personal operating system: a quiet place where goals, memories, reflection, spiritual growth, and learning can live together.</p>
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">Instead of chasing productivity, it helps preserve the story of who you are becoming.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <span class="ziyu-label">Experience</span>
    <h2 class="ziyu-h2" style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 80px;">A digital archive for your real life.</h2>

    <div class="ziyu-grid-3">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">auto_stories</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Personal Archive</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Journal entries, milestones, memories, and reflections gathered into one long-term record.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">explore</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Life Realms</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Separate areas for learning, health, spirituality, relationships, creativity, and work.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">timeline</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Long-Term Becoming</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">A system built around growth over years, not just daily task completion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);">Future Vision</span>
    <h2 class="ziyu-h2">Your life deserves a better archive.</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);">MyJourney is a long-term concept for making personal growth feel calm, connected, and meaningful.</p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--light" style="margin-top: 36px;">Follow Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

